step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Note: If you've already completed <col=800000>The Lost Tribe</col>, you can get to Juna via the <col=800000>Lumbridge Castle</col> cave. This negates the need for the <col=800000>Spiny helmet</col> or <col=800000>Slayer helmet</col>. Having a lit <col=800000>Sapphire lantern</col> with oil saves time as well.</col>
